                                "sense_id": "437dce98-6ab3-30d4-8627-0d9b57e2f746",
                                "text": "...with a rudimentary beard to set it off, a dirty shirt, a rifle, a coat over my arm, and half a grouse in my knickerbocker pocket."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02529d15-eca8-42c9-ba58-fa0bc5c0c023",
                                "sense_id": "437dce98-6ab3-30d4-8627-0d9b57e2f746",
                                "text": "His knickerbocker days are gone,\nHis last long stockings laid away:\nMy baby has his trousers on, —\nMy boy becomes a man to-day."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
